[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5173\uff08\u540e\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_indoor_n",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The... the Yetis...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I feel so bad for them to all die in Lungmen like that. One less hope, one less legend for the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Move it. The L. G. D. are on the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...There's something not quite right about your eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be honest, I always thought you were a spy for Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How about now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No one would believe it anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A real spy would kill you to keep you quiet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not worried about you killing me. Look at the state of Lungmen. Even if you were a Lungmenite, you can't go back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd have an even worse time than we did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...So I'm not. I'm not really anything anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing? Wow, is that a flower?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oooh, is this your Arts? It's pretty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone has to leave them a token of respect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_indoor_f",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such dilly-dallying... such a waste of time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_041"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think it was well done. I can give top marks for wiping out the entire Reunion Movement in the city of Lungmen in a single day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_040"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wei Yenwu is impressive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_041"
    },
    {
        "text": "Taihe, have you heard that rumor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You speak of Wei Yenwu's history?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_040"
    },
    {
        "text": "Delve not into such things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Forgive me. But how do the skills of the Black Cloaks compare to those of the Imperial Guard?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. You overestimate them. But they do indeed have some exceptional skill...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_040"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You bastards!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_041"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hiss!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Wire?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't really want to kill me, do you? You can use Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I've always heard that men who use wires as weapons are all, literally all, psychopaths.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed, they do say that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Infected, do not interfere with official business. Take care that I lump you in with the others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not much to be done about unidentified armed units getting killed on the battlefield, is there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We can likewise testify that you are acting in coordination with Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have the authority to investigate my partner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_041",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We are well aware that a vessel belonging to an 'Infected Countermeasures Specialist' is docked in a Lungmen berth, Superintendent Ch'en. This is the only reason Miss Blaze has not yet come to harm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_041",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then how much more do you need to see? How much more must you test the people of this city with their very lives?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Speak with respect. We are assessing Lungmen's risk control capabilities due to the importance with which we regard you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then forgive me. I'll rephrase.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you enjoying this farce?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pfft.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stand down, Blaze. We do not serve these fine, upstanding individuals, and they're not with the raincoats either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Apologies, Miss Blaze. I hope I did not cause you any displeasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...You're very polite. But your tone pisses me off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You have an ear for Yan speech.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You inherited much from your father. Alas, now you are but an Infected. Your path is rough. And short.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_041",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......You......?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_040"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_041"
    },
    {
        "text": "Goodbye then, Miss Blaze, Superintendent Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait! What did you just say about my dad?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember the mission!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Officer Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We found no trace of the enemy commander.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Which?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We only know of Mephisto.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let Rhodes Island handle the rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to rush into it. This campaign is all but over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But he has to pay... for the atrocities he committed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we'll leave it to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's part ways for now. I have one more thing I need to see with my own eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a minute, L. G. D. lady.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Thanks for that, back there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. You too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you have to pick that moment to act? Blaze... You're not the type to make mistakes at a time like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "For one thing, I was really mad...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "For another, I could tell that L. G. D. lady, Ch'en, was getting mad too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We also can't tell which of the two sides has the right to speak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So I pick the one I like.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry. It won't happen again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No, Blaze. It's my turn to say it won't happen again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I can't say that. I can't promise that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Yetis...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Silly rabbit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, don't pat my head. I need to get taller...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...At least, don't pat it too long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you feel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You.;......;Can I help you?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I was in the neighborhood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your emotional state is fluctuating. It seems you had a deeper interaction with this Reunion unit in the Chernobog ruins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "As far as I can tell, the captain of this unit did not participate in the battle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "That means...",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen won't keep chasing these Infected. But Rhodes Island has to do more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen won't interfere with what happens next. And you can choose not to participate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...But you will participate. Whether the Infected is codenamed 'Mephisto' or 'FrostNova.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Where are you going?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I have my work cut out for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, and Dr. {@nickname}......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't look at me like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Stop with the cloak and dagger.;......;Amiya said Rhodes Island needs trust.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you and I don't need trust.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need the trust of Rhodes Island's operators, not me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014I know you too well to trust you. Just like you never trusted me, in the old days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "How would I know the old days?;The old days?;Is there anything I can do about it now?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I misspoke. Forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful in the next operation. Only the most dangerous of commanders would train such a squad of Infected who would fight to the death without flinching.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, it's up to you if you want to see it through to the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "And do conserve your energy. We may not have time to rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "The battle for Lungmen is over.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not that simple. At least, that's what I think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, from now on, it's up to you to decide if you will shoulder the burden of responsibility for Rhodes Island...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...'Whether or not to be one worthy of the trust of a Rhodes Island operator.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_undergroud_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, FrostNova, ma'am, you're awake...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Take it easy! Let me help you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine. I'm not... so fragile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you going? You can't go back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, my brothers and sisters...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...You can't go back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was for your sake that they...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't insult my squad!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1#9",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They did... *cough* look out for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it was for the Infected that they gave their lives so bravely!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "They fought their last battle so that more of their people could live, not for the sake of any one person!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough* *cough hack* *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough* Guh... Mmg...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova, ma'am...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough with the ma'am. Are you calling me that because I look weak to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just, they put you in our care like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And now they're gone, and I never got to keep my promises to them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't even have a chance to make amends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...The one slumped at the wall there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mephisto.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's still unconscious?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't know. He's been like that the whole time. He says nothing. Does nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take him back. It's enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood. Phew, I thought you'd...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought you'd kill him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no need for that anymore. I think I know what happened outside the slums.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "That disheartened look in his eyes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...And, from time to time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I recall that day, three or four years ago, when he tried his very hardest to sing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He can sing? But Faust said, his throat...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He really tried.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like all of us Infected. Though we will all someday succumb to Oripathy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "We still try our very hardest to live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let the rest of his life continue to punish him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me, Phantom Crossbowman, was Rhodes Island involved in that fight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you mean...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No, as far as I know, they didn't fight the Yetis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...So childish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure you want to stay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "They may not come after us, FrostNova. You don't have to die here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I met a few people in the ruins. I want to see them again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I promised them, actually.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I know they're coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on, brother.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion lost this battle. And just maybe, Reunion did wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you haven't. You still have a choice, you can do better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on. And don't look back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
